WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:36.416
<b>Krishna explained how desire</b>
<b>covers the human soul.</b>

2
00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:43.125
<b>And now here, He explains how </b>
<b>this enemy called desire never stops.</b>

3
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.708
<b>Krishna says that</b>

4
00:00:49.708 --> 00:00:55.166
<b>human intellect becomes clouded before</b>
<b>this enemy called desire.</b>

5
00:00:55.166 --> 00:01:00.208
<b>And this desire is like a </b>
<b>fire that can never be satisfied.</b>

6
00:01:00.208 --> 00:01:04.541
<b>A person under the influence of </b>
<b>desire becomes devoid of wisdom.</b>

7
00:01:04.541 --> 00:01:09.791
<b>Such a person identifies only with </b>
<b>this physical body as their existence.</b>

8
00:01:09.791 --> 00:01:14.208
<b>And this becomes the cause </b>
<b>of their pain and suffering.</b>

9
00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:20.000
<b>And most concerning is that this </b>
<b>desire knows no peace.</b>

10
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.125
<b>Like a forest fire, once ignited,</b>

11
00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:32.583
<b>remains unsatisfied until it </b>
<b>reduces every single tree to ashes.</b>

12
00:01:32.583 --> 00:01:37.375
<b>This fire spreads from one tree </b>
<b>to another, only growing.</b>

13
00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:42.916
<b>Similarly, desire isn't quieted </b>
<b>by fulfilling one wish;</b>

14
00:01:42.916 --> 00:01:49.958
<b>it keeps growing from one craving </b>
<b>to another, only intensifying.</b>

15
00:01:49.958 --> 00:01:51.708
<b>If not stopped,</b>

16
00:01:51.708 --> 00:01:56.333
<b>like a forest fire, it too will destroy the person.</b>

17
00:01:56.333 --> 00:01:58.666
<b>To control this fire,</b>

18
00:01:58.666 --> 00:02:02.333
<b>the coolness of spirituality is the only solution.</b>

19
00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:07.166
<b>The more spiritual knowledge </b>
<b>you absorb and follow,</b>

20
00:02:07.166 --> 00:02:09.791
<b>the more this desire will diminish.</b>

21
00:02:09.791 --> 00:02:15.458
<b>Through this Gita, you have begun walking </b>
<b>in this direction.</b>

22
00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:24.291
<b>A small fire in the forest</b>

23
00:02:24.291 --> 00:02:26.875
<b>provides warmth,</b>

24
00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:28.958
<b>provides warmth, gives light and</b>

25
00:02:28.958 --> 00:02:32.250
<b>helps cook food.</b>

26
00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:35.000
<b>All this seems quite harmless.</b>

27
00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.500
<b>But</b>

28
00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.041
<b>what if</b>

29
00:02:38.041 --> 00:02:46.625
<b>someone keeps adding dry leaves and wood to it?</b>

30
00:02:46.625 --> 00:02:49.333
<b>This fire will blaze.</b>

31
00:02:49.333 --> 00:02:54.500
<b>And if that person shows </b>
<b>foolishness and doesn't stop,</b>

32
00:02:54.500 --> 00:03:00.458
<b>then this fire will grow beyond their control.</b>

33
00:03:00.458 --> 00:03:03.416
<b>It will spread on its own,</b>

34
00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:09.916
<b>and before you know it,</b>
<b>will consume the entire forest.</b>

35
00:03:09.916 --> 00:03:13.875
<b>The desires of passion are just like this.</b>

36
00:03:13.875 --> 00:03:17.416
<b>At a small level, they seem satisfying.</b>

37
00:03:17.416 --> 00:03:20.416
<b>They bring joy to life.</b>

38
00:03:20.416 --> 00:03:25.125
<b>Eating favorite foods, </b>
<b>wearing nice clothes, and such.</b>

39
00:03:25.125 --> 00:03:26.458
<b>But</b>

40
00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:33.083
<b>if one shows foolishness and </b>
<b>begins to indulge beyond necessity,</b>

41
00:03:33.083 --> 00:03:35.625
<b>these passions will flare up.</b>

42
00:03:35.625 --> 00:03:39.125
<b>They will demand more and more fulfillment.</b>

43
00:03:39.125 --> 00:03:46.000
<b>And then a time will come when the </b>
<b>person becomes enslaved to them.</b>

44
00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:52.083
<b>And just as an uncontrolled fire </b>
<b>can burn down an entire forest,</b>

45
00:03:52.083 --> 00:03:59.083
<b>these passions will completely</b>
<b>destroy that person's wisdom.</b>

46
00:03:59.083 --> 00:04:00.875
<b> Under the influence of this fire,</b>

47
00:04:00.875 --> 00:04:07.750
<b>one forgets everything important in life.</b>

48
00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:10.125
<b>Relationships with loved ones,</b>

49
00:04:10.125 --> 00:04:14.041
<b>playing a positive role in society,</b>

50
00:04:14.041 --> 00:04:17.666
<b>and their spiritual progress.</b>

51
00:04:17.666 --> 00:04:25.791
<b>The solution to calm this fire of </b>
<b>passion isn't indulgence, but restraint.</b>

52
00:04:25.791 --> 00:04:29.916
<b>Try saying 'no' to unnecessary and futile desires –</b>

53
00:04:29.916 --> 00:04:33.208
<b>it's truly liberating.</b>

54
00:04:33.208 --> 00:04:34.416
<b>Also,</b>

55
00:04:34.416 --> 00:04:37.791
<b>keep increasing the coolness of spirituality.</b>

56
00:04:37.791 --> 00:04:41.583
<b>It won't let this fire flourish.</b>

57
00:04:41.583 --> 00:04:43.083
<b>On this path,</b>

58
00:04:43.083 --> 00:04:46.083
<b>I am with you.</b>

59
00:04:46.083 --> 00:04:47.375
<b>Come.</b>

60
00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:55.541
<b>Uncontrolled desires</b>

61
00:04:55.541 --> 00:04:59.041
<b>can harm not just an individual,</b>

62
00:04:59.041 --> 00:05:00.250
<b>but</b>

63
00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:04.958
<b>the entire family.</b>

64
00:05:04.958 --> 00:05:08.666
<b>The foundation of family is love,</b>

65
00:05:08.666 --> 00:05:12.291
<b>time given to each other.</b>

66
00:05:12.291 --> 00:05:16.875
<b>It's transparency and mutual cooperation.</b>

67
00:05:16.875 --> 00:05:21.250
<b>Uncontrolled indulgence</b>
<b>isn't the foundation of family;</b>

68
00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:25.875
<b>rather, it can hollow out the family.</b>

69
00:05:25.875 --> 00:05:29.708
<b>And nowadays there are countless temptations,</b>

70
00:05:29.708 --> 00:05:36.625
<b>just waiting for people to be attracted to them.</b>

71
00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:41.500
<b>And through these temptations, </b>
<b>desires grow intense.</b>

72
00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:44.958
<b>The fire of passion keeps growing.</b>

73
00:05:44.958 --> 00:05:47.666
<b>Children or adults,</b>

74
00:05:47.666 --> 00:05:52.125
<b>everyone today has a phone,</b>

75
00:05:52.125 --> 00:05:59.375
<b>some alluring video keeps playing </b>
<b>before everyone's eyes.</b>

76
00:05:59.375 --> 00:06:02.916
<b>You yourself know</b>

77
00:06:02.916 --> 00:06:13.625
<b>what kinds of programs reach you and </b>
<b>your children through this phone.</b>

78
00:06:13.625 --> 00:06:14.541
<b>And</b>

79
00:06:14.541 --> 00:06:17.000
<b>you also know</b>

80
00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:24.208
<b>that many of these programs are </b>
<b>extremely harmful to children.</b>

81
00:06:24.208 --> 00:06:25.833
<b>Wake up,</b>

82
00:06:25.833 --> 00:06:27.916
<b>not just for children,</b>

83
00:06:27.916 --> 00:06:32.458
<b>many of these are harmful for you too.</b>

84
00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:34.208
<b>For example, </b>

85
00:06:34.208 --> 00:06:40.875
<b>just scrolling on the phone, </b>
<b>an important task gets missed.</b>

86
00:06:40.875 --> 00:06:47.375
<b>Saw new items, now the mind craves to buy them.</b>

87
00:06:47.375 --> 00:06:59.666
<b>And countless such programs whose purpose</b>
<b>is to tempt you towards sensual desires.</b>

88
00:06:59.666 --> 00:07:03.291
<b>Is it even necessary to tell?</b>

89
00:07:03.291 --> 00:07:08.791
<b>That this can be harmful for you and your family?</b>

90
00:07:08.791 --> 00:07:10.833
<b>First,</b>

91
00:07:10.833 --> 00:07:13.208
<b>become alert.</b>

92
00:07:13.208 --> 00:07:18.625
<b>Today phones/computers are essential tools.</b>

93
00:07:18.625 --> 00:07:21.041
<b>They make life easier.</b>

94
00:07:21.041 --> 00:07:23.708
<b>But remember this –</b>

95
00:07:23.708 --> 00:07:29.166
<b>these devices are your servants, </b>
<b>don't become their servant.</b>

96
00:07:29.166 --> 00:07:31.750
<b>Several measures can be taken:</b>

97
00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:33.500
<b>Create some rules.</b>

98
00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:37.333
<b>That apply to both adults and children –</b>

99
00:07:37.333 --> 00:07:39.333
<b>adults will follow them,</b>

100
00:07:39.333 --> 00:07:43.250
<b>only then will children accept guidance.</b>

101
00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:46.083
<b>Time limits can be set.</b>

102
00:07:46.083 --> 00:07:51.583
<b>TV, computer, phone etc. should </b>
<b>be used in limited amounts.</b>

103
00:07:51.583 --> 00:07:55.458
<b>Have mature discussions on this topic –</b>

104
00:07:55.458 --> 00:07:58.958
<b>what programs are appropriate, </b>
<b>what inappropriate,</b>

105
00:07:58.958 --> 00:08:00.583
<b>and why.</b>

106
00:08:00.583 --> 00:08:02.291
<b>One part of the day,</b>

107
00:08:02.291 --> 00:08:04.541
<b>like</b>

108
00:08:04.541 --> 00:08:06.000
<b>mealtime.</b>

109
00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:09.708
<b>When no one has any device in hand.</b>

110
00:08:09.708 --> 00:08:14.458
<b>Discussion happens about parents'</b>
<b>and children's daily routines.</b>

111
00:08:14.458 --> 00:08:18.083
<b>Channel children's energy in the right direction.</b>

112
00:08:18.083 --> 00:08:23.666
<b>Sports, some artistic activity, </b>
<b>some other positive interest.</b>

113
00:08:23.666 --> 00:08:25.458
<b>There are many solutions,</b>

114
00:08:25.458 --> 00:08:28.958
<b>but the beginning will be with self-reflection.</b>

115
00:08:28.958 --> 00:08:32.166
<b>It will start with asking yourself these questions:</b>

116
00:08:32.166 --> 00:08:37.333
<b>Are family members giving their </b>
<b>valuable time to what?</b>

117
00:08:37.333 --> 00:08:38.708
<b>To each other?</b>

118
00:08:38.708 --> 00:08:40.750
<b>To positive activities?</b>

119
00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:45.375
<b>Or to these devices?</b>

120
00:08:45.375 --> 00:08:47.083
<b>Think about it.</b>

121
00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:57.791
<b>Today you must have spent </b>
<b>some years in professional life.</b>

122
00:08:57.791 --> 00:08:58.791
<b>Now</b>

123
00:08:58.791 --> 00:09:01.791
<b>think once,</b>

124
00:09:01.791 --> 00:09:05.000
<b>when this journey began,</b>

125
00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:09.916
<b>what were your goals at that exact time?</b>

126
00:09:09.916 --> 00:09:19.125
<b>Often it's seen that we've long </b>
<b>achieved our initial goals.</b>

127
00:09:19.125 --> 00:09:21.166
<b>But we don't stop,</b>

128
00:09:21.166 --> 00:09:24.208
<b>we set new goals.</b>

129
00:09:24.208 --> 00:09:31.500
<b>This reaction of achieving goals </b>
<b>and setting new ones continues.</b>

130
00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:34.875
<b>Is this wrong?</b>

131
00:09:34.875 --> 00:09:36.833
<b>Absolutely not.</b>

132
00:09:36.833 --> 00:09:38.750
<b>This indeed is progress –</b>

133
00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:40.500
<b>achieving one goal,</b>

134
00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:43.000
<b>setting another.</b>

135
00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:47.500
<b>But self-reflection is necessary.</b>

136
00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:53.375
<b>Has this process of achieving </b>
<b>goals become a race?</b>

137
00:09:53.375 --> 00:10:04.583
<b>And in this race, are you neglecting your physical </b>
<b>health, your mental health, your family?</b>

138
00:10:04.583 --> 00:10:06.208
<b>Moreover,</b>

139
00:10:06.208 --> 00:10:09.791
<b>is this even your race?</b>

140
00:10:09.791 --> 00:10:11.625
<b>Isn't it</b>

141
00:10:11.625 --> 00:10:17.541
<b>possible that in comparing with others,</b>
<b>you've lost your way?</b>

142
00:10:17.541 --> 00:10:22.000
<b>You were content with your house, your car,</b>

143
00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:22.958
<b>but</b>

144
00:10:22.958 --> 00:10:30.125
<b>now since a colleague has a bigger car, </b>
<b>your desire has awakened?</b>

145
00:10:30.125 --> 00:10:36.125
<b>Someone got a bigger house </b>
<b>so you must have one too?</b>

146
00:10:36.125 --> 00:10:39.375
<b>Your interest was in another department,</b>

147
00:10:39.375 --> 00:10:42.000
<b>but due to financial attraction,</b>

148
00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:51.916
<b>you changed your department and now </b>
<b>work isn't as enjoyable as it was before.</b>

149
00:10:51.916 --> 00:10:55.125
<b>Human desires are</b>

150
00:10:55.125 --> 00:10:57.166
<b>very clever.</b>

151
00:10:57.166 --> 00:10:58.666
<b>One is fulfilled,</b>

152
00:10:58.666 --> 00:11:00.583
<b>another awakens.</b>

153
00:11:00.583 --> 00:11:03.458
<b>And the problem arises </b>

154
00:11:03.458 --> 00:11:06.916
<b>when humans forget</b>

155
00:11:06.916 --> 00:11:11.541
<b> that life's purpose isn't just fulfilling desires.</b>

156
00:11:11.541 --> 00:11:12.875
<b>Stop.</b>

157
00:11:12.875 --> 00:11:14.458
<b>Think.</b>

158
00:11:14.458 --> 00:11:17.208
<b>Ask yourself.</b>

159
00:11:17.208 --> 00:11:20.958
<b>Are you happy with life?</b>

160
00:11:20.958 --> 00:11:25.166
<b>What is your life's purpose?</b>

161
00:11:25.166 --> 00:11:28.541
<b>Somewhere in chasing </b>
<b>professional achievements,</b>

162
00:11:28.541 --> 00:11:34.958
<b>positions and salaries,</b>
<b>hasn't life been left behind?</b>

163
00:11:34.958 --> 00:11:37.458
<b>To escape this cycle,</b>

164
00:11:37.458 --> 00:11:45.166
<b>making contemplation and self-observation </b>
<b>part of your daily routine is necessary.</b>

165
00:11:45.166 --> 00:11:46.250
<b>Yes,</b>

166
00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:49.458
<b>when thinking on these subjects becomes deep,</b>

167
00:11:49.458 --> 00:11:50.458
<b>perhaps,</b>

168
00:11:50.458 --> 00:11:54.916
<b>the mind might become troubled </b>
<b>and there might be confusion.</b>

169
00:11:54.916 --> 00:12:01.083
<b>If this happens, take the support </b>
<b>of meditation and spirituality.</b>

170
00:12:01.083 --> 00:12:03.208
<b>This will give you balance,</b>

171
00:12:03.208 --> 00:12:06.125
<b>and show you the right path.</b>

172
00:12:06.125 --> 00:12:07.583
<b>I,</b>

173
00:12:07.583 --> 00:12:10.125
<b>and my best wishes,</b>

174
00:12:10.125 --> 00:12:12.500
<b>both are with you.</b>

